# Setup

Get the Wyrd Python SDK installed and pointed at a registry.

## Prerequisites

- Python 3.10 or later
- A running `wyrd-server` instance (local or remote)
- Optional: Docker Compose for a one-command local registry

## Pages

- [Install](/setup/install/) — install py-wyrd, verify the SDK, and run the health check.
